1045 0 obj
  << /ActualText (EXPERIENCE \n\nFieldAI\nSenior Software Engineer\n\042  Lead development of dashboard for gas and \n    thermal inspection missions conducted by \n    autonomous robots\n\042  Reduce payload size of API that fetches gas\n    readings by over 1000x from \1761mb\057s to \1761kb\057s\n\nSmack Technologies\nProduct Engineer\n\042  Deliver company\031s first product\054 which generates\n    predictive ISR plans\056 Secured a follow\055up \n    government contract following its successful demo\056\n\042  Serve as lead engineer on a fires planning product\056  \n    Develop the project road map \046 onboard \046\n    manage a team of three software engineers\056\n\042  Integrate temporal\054 reducing latency by 6X and \n    adding observability to workflows\056\n\nGoogle\nSoftware Engineer III\n\042 \tCreate a self serve tool to reject and backfill \n    feedback from problematic human raters\056 Used on \n    tens of thousands of feedbacks as part of effort to \n    improve data quality\056\n\042 \tInvestigate EWOQ billing\054 resulting in a refactor with \n    table\055valued\055functions \046 GoogleSQL tests plus the \n    discovery \046 fix of a bug in task time computation\054 \n    resulting in savings of over \0441\0562 million a year\n\042 \tMigrate authorization service APIs to support \n    Zanzibar IAM authorization\n\042 \tDevelop evaluation details page for third party \n    vendors\056\n\042 \tPerform backfill of rater employment records\056 \n    Develop launch plan\054 validate changes via SQL \n    queries\054 and update admin portal to support \n    setting\054 updating\054 and validating the new field\056\n\042 \tFix \046 improve team\031s latency dashboard by adding \n    filter options \046 timeseries charts\n\042 \tMigrate EWOQ user details page from GWT to \n    Angular Dart\n\nCornerstone OnDemand\054 Inc\nSoftware Engineer\n\042 \tSupport in beta release of point\055in\055time headcount \n    reporting\050\042  Add event tracking via Amplitude Analytics to \n    analyze user behavior and improve prioritization of \n    upcoming team projects\056)
     /K [ 10 ]
